    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>ClearDB is discontinuing the Mercury DB and Titan DB service plans in the Microsoft Azure platform. Upgrading is simple through the&nbsp;Azure portal.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For&nbsp;details, see the <a href=\"https://w2.cleardb.net/cos-azure-mercury-titan/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">announcement on the ClearDB website</a>.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "ClearDB is discontinuing the Mercury DB and Titan DB service plans in the Microsoft Azure platform. Upgrading is simple through the Azure portal.\n\nFor details, see the announcement on the ClearDB website ."
  },
